  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-mode=\"public\" data-zone=\"home\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>CANOPTICON — The standing record</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Forensic intelligence. Sourced, structured, permanent. Mapping the architecture of systems and institutions through sourced claims and signed analysis.\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400;1,6..72,500;1,6..72,600&display=swap\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=4u1lyx\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n<nav class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"nav-inner\">\n    <a href=\"/\" class=\"wordmark\">CANOPTICON<span class=\"dot\">·</span><span class=\"wordmark-sub\">The standing record</span></a>\n    <div class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"active\">Record</a>\n      <a href=\"/investigations\">Investigations</a>\n      <a href=\"/method\">Method</a>\n      <a href=\"/search\" class=\"nav-search\"><span class=\"q\">/</span> ask the record</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n<main class=\"record-main\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<section style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">\n  <div class=\"kicker\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px\">\n    <span class=\"live\"></span> Forensic intelligence · sourced, structured, permanent\n  </div>\n  <h1 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:48px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--ink)\">Canopticon keeps files on power.</h1>\n  <p style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:680px\">\n    A forensic intelligence system — mapping the architecture of systems and\n    institutions through sourced claims, signed analysis, and a growing graph of\n    verified connections. The facts are the foundation. The patterns are the point.\n  </p>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n  <div class=\"row between\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding-bottom:9px;margin-bottom:16px\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Four ways in</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cards-3\"><a class=\"cardlink\" href=\"/topics\">\n  <div class=\"card-type t-topic\">The index</div>\n  <div class=\"card-title\">Browse the record</div>\n  <div class=\"card-dek\">Every file in the record — people, companies, events, and the widely-held stories the documents push back on. Nobody wrote these pages; they grew as sources were read.</div>\n</a><a class=\"cardlink\" href=\"/investigations\">\n  <div class=\"card-type t-essay\">Signed analysis</div>\n  <div class=\"card-title\">Investigations</div>\n  <div class=\"card-dek\">The signed analyses. Each one wears its intent as a badge; every load-bearing claim ties back to the file it stands on.</div>\n</a><a class=\"cardlink\" href=\"/library\">\n  <div class=\"card-type t-research-report\">The raw research</div>\n  <div class=\"card-title\">Library</div>\n  <div class=\"card-dek\">Every source document the record is built on — kept whole, kept honest.</div>\n</a><a class=\"cardlink\" href=\"/method\">\n  <div class=\"card-type t-pattern\">How this works</div>\n  <div class=\"card-title\">Method</div>\n  <div class=\"card-dek\">How verification works: word-for-word quotes, independent judging, and disputed material shown as disputed, never quietly as fact.</div>\n</a></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</main>\n<aside class=\"trust\" aria-label=\"How this site verifies\">\n  <div class=\"trust-inner\">\n    <span class=\"trust-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span>\n    <p>\n      Every documented fact on this site is backed by a word-for-word quote\n      from a source document we have stored — checked by machine, not vouched\n      for. Disputed claims are shown as disputed. Claims that fail\n      verification are removed, and we say so.\n      <a href=\"/method\">How verification works →</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</aside>\n<footer class=\"foot\">\n  <div class=\"foot-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"wordmark\">CANOPTICON<span class=\"dot\">·</span></a>\n      <div class=\"coord\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">THE STANDING RECORD <span class=\"sep\">·</span> canopticon.com <span class=\"sep\">·</span> @canoptics</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot-links\">\n      <a href=\"/\">The Record</a>\n      <a href=\"/investigations\">Investigations</a>\n      <a href=\"/method\">Method</a>\n      <a href=\"/search\">Search</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
